    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis charming 4 bedroom cottage is situated in the idyllic setting of Rinevella Bay, only a five minute drive from Carrigaholt village and easy access of Kilkee beach. Set on a 0.288 acre site with amazing water views, this property is over 100 years old and was substantially extended in 1978. Accommodation is well proportioned comprising 95 sqm and includes a generous reception room, kitchen, bathroom and 4 bedrooms. Externally, there are a number of stone sheds that may be suitable for conversion and a lovely private and secluded garden. This property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, which is up to 50,000. Due to the size, views and location of this property, it would make a fine starter home, retirement or holiday home. Viewings are recommended to appreciate the potential on offer. BER G."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nReception Room - \nThis inviting reception area is complete with an oil fired range, high ceilings, timber panel detail to walls, casement style windows and and Lino flooring.\n\nKitchen - \nThe kitchen is complete with fully fitted wall and base units, lino flooring and is plumbed. Rear access\n\nBedroom 1 - \nThis spacious double bedroom has fantastic water views. Complete with carpet flooring, high ceilings, casement windows, built in wardrobes and a solid fuel feature fireplace. Could also be another sititng room if preferred.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nAlso located to the front of the property, this spacious bedroom is complete with timber panel detailing to the walls, casement stykle windows and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nLocated to the back of the property, this double bedroom is complete with lino flooring and high ceilings.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nAlso located to the back of the property and complete with carpet flooring and high ceilings.\n\nBathroom - \nComplete with bath, wc and whb.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Charming 4 bedroom cottage dating over 100 years old</li><li>Substantially extended in 1978</li><li>Located only 5 minute drive from Carrigaholt village and walking distance of Rinevella Bay</li><li>Would benefit from modernisation</li><li>Fabulous water views</li><li>Number of detached sheds which may be suitable for conversion - subject to necessary PP</ul>"
      },
